### Pillar 4: Events, Reunions & Capacity RSVPs

#### Flow & Algorithm
- **Endpoint**: `GET /api/events`, `POST /api/events/:id/rsvp`, `DELETE /api/events/:id/rsvp`
- **Data Model**: `Event` (`title`, `date`, `location`, `isVirtual`, `maxCapacity`) $\longleftrightarrow$ `EventRSVP` (`eventId`, `userId`).
- **Capacity Algorithm**:
  ```javascript
  const rsvp = await prisma.$transaction(async (tx) => {
    const event = await tx.event.findUnique({
      where: { id: eventId },
      include: { _count: { select: { rsvps: true } } }
    });
    if (event.maxCapacity && event._count.rsvps >= event.maxCapacity) {
      throw new Error('EVENT_CAPACITY_REACHED');
    }
    return tx.eventRSVP.create({ data: { eventId, userId } });
  });
  ```
- **"Who's Going" Roster**: Aggregates verified attendees by category (`ALUMNI` vs `STUDENT`), allowing students to see which alumni will be at the reunion.

