## 5. Mobile App Synergy (React Native / Expo Ready)

Because our backend is a pure, decoupled Express REST + Socket.io server:
1. **Zero Backend Rewrite**: The mobile app will use the exact same URLs (`https://.../api/users`, `/api/jobs`, etc.).
2. **Shared Types**: Frontend TypeScript types in `lib/types.ts` are 100% copy-pasteable into the React Native project.
3. **Expo Push Notifications**: The backend notification service can dispatch to Expo Push API (`https://exp.host/--/api/v2/push/send`) at zero cost.

